OL,3,GNEWSADelays on M5 following two-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are facing long delays on the
OL,7,FM5 in Somerset after it was shut in
OL,8,Fboth directions in Somerset earlier
OL,9,Fafter a crash involving two vehicles.
OL,11,FNational Highways said traffic had been
OL,12,Fstopped between junction 25 at Taunton
OL,13,Fand junction 24 at Bridgwater.
OL,15,FTwo lanes of traffic are now open
OL,16,Fsouthbound, but the northbound
OL,17,Fcarriageway remains closed.
OL,19,FAvon and Somerset Police said one
OL,20,Fperson had been airlifted to hospital
OL,21,Ffollowing the collision.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
